    "regime_notes": "Passes benchmark-wide daily IC and ICIR gates across 3,383 observations, but predictive strength deteriorates materially in 2026-2030 and multi-day decay is strongly negative. Treat as a short-horizon, low-weight overlay rather than a standalone 3-10 day forecast."
  },
